"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"BHK 412 000 → 440 000, MIH 1 271 000 → 1 360 000"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"2026-yil 1-sentabridan ikkala bazaviy miqdor 2026-yil 23-iyundagi PF-115 Farmoni bilan 7% ga oshirildi: bazaviy hisoblash kattaligi 412 000 dan 440 000 so'mgacha, minimal ish haqi 1 271 000 dan 1 360 000 so'mgacha. BHK qonun uning kratlarida belgilagan hamma narsani qayta baholaydi: OSAGOsiz haydash uchun jarima 440 000 so'm bo'ldi, yuridik shaxsni ro'yxatdan o'tkazish boji — 440 000 so'm, QQS bo'yicha majburiy ro'yxatdan o'tish chegarasi (12 000 BHK) — 5 280 000 000 so'm. MIH dan JShShS imtiyozlari hisoblanadi: moddiy yordam (4,22 MIH) yiliga 5 739 200 so'mgacha, ipotekani to'lash imtiyozi (80 MIH) — 108 800 000 so'mgacha oshdi. Barcha kalkulyatorlar, maqolalar, FAQ va hisob misollari qayta hisoblandi."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"BHK ni Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori emas, Prezident Farmoni belgilaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"FAQ ning o'zbekcha versiyasida BHK Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori bilan yangilanadi deb yozilgan edi. Aslida BHK miqdori Prezident Farmoni bilan belgilanadi — xuddi shu maqolaning ruscha versiyasida to'g'ri ko'rsatilgan. Ta'riflar bir xillashtirildi."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2026-08-31",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 31-avgust"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":["$L3","$L4"]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7"]}]]}],"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"]}],"$L13"]}],null,"$L14"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"tiXmGC5WDKODjdEEJHa70"}
3:["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Bojxona rasmiylashtiruvi to'rt oylik eski kurs bo'yicha hisoblanardi"}]
4:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Bojxona kalkulyatori dollar kursini cbu.uz dan emas, kodga qat'iy yozilgan 11 938 so'mdan — MB ning 2026-yil 1-may kursidan olardi. Konstanta zaxira deb atalgan bo'lsa-da, komponent jonli kursni umuman so'ramagan, shuning uchun zaxira yagona yo'l edi. Haqiqiy kurs 11 801,23 bo'lganda boj va QQS taxminan 1,2% ga oshib ketardi: 20 000 dollarlik avtomobilda bu ~2,5 mln so'm ortiqcha. Kalkulyator MB ning jonli kursiga ulandi, natija ostida esa hisob qaysi kurs va sana bo'yicha qilingani ko'rsatiladi."}]
5:["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Yoqilg'i narxlari to'rt oyga eskirgan, maqolalarda esa sotuvdan olingan AI-91 saqlanib qolgan edi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Yoqilg'i sarfi kalkulyatori aprel narxlari bo'yicha hisoblardi: AI-95 haqiqiy 16 200 o'rniga 13 500, AI-100 24 000 o'rniga 16 000, dizel 14 200 o'rniga 12 500 turgan. 8 l/100 km sarfda 500 km sayohat 108 000 so'mga kam ko'rsatilardi. Kalkulyatorda o'z narxini kiritib bo'lmaydi, shuning uchun konstanta javobning o'zi. Narxlar 2026-yil 28-avgustdagi Toshkent o'rtacha narxlari bo'yicha yangilandi va sana qo'shildi. Bundan tashqari maqola va FAQ da endi sotilmaydigan AI-91 benzini saqlanib qolgan, sayohat misollari ham unga hisoblangan edi; misollar qayta hisoblandi va ulardagi ziddiyat (ruscha matn metanda 3,4 marta tejash va'da qilgan, o'zbekcha 2,7 — bir xil raqamlarda) tuzatildi: to'g'risi 2,5 marta. Propan narxi o'zgarmadi va tasdiqlanmagan deb belgilandi."}]]}]
6:["$","article","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Boshqa valyutalarning zaxira kurslari dollardan ham ko'proq eskirgan edi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Faqat dollarni emas, butun zaxira kurslar jadvalini tekshirdik. Turk lirasi haqiqiy 245 o'rniga 380 so'm turgan — 55 foiz xato. Iyena 74 o'rniga 86, BAA dirhami 3 213 o'rniga 3 500, qirg'iz somi 135 o'rniga 145, von 8,55 o'rniga 9,5. Bu kurslar faqat cbu.uz mavjud bo'lmaganda ishlatiladi, lekin bunday farqda ular bo'sh maydondan ham zararli. Butun jadval MB ning 2026-yil 28-avgust kurslari bo'yicha yangilandi va sanasi qo'shildi."}]]}]
7:["$","article","3",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Dollarning zaxira kursi endi bitta joyda"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"USD zaxira kursi to'rtta nusxada yashagan va barchasi farq qilgan: bank stavkalari, vizalar, pul o'tkazmalari va konvertorda 12 850 so'm, bojxonada 11 938. Bundan tashqari hisob misollari uchinchi kurs — 12 700 bo'yicha hisoblangan. Nusxalar bitta modulga jamlandi, misollar esa MB ning 2026-yil 28-avgust kursi bo'yicha qayta hisoblandi va kurs sanasi hisobning o'zida ko'rsatildi."}]]}]
8:["$","section","2026-08-18",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 18-avgust"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"QQS: hisobot faqat yiriklarda emas, hammada oylik"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"100 mlrd so'mdan ortiq aylanmaga ega to'lovchilar har oy, qolganlari chorakda bir marta hisobot beradi deb yozgan edik. Bu ikki tomonlama xato: bunday chegara yo'q, choraklik tartibning o'zi esa 2022-yil 1-yanvardan bekor qilingan. QQS bo'yicha soliq davri — aylanmadan qat'i nazar barcha uchun oy; deklaratsiya va to'lov — keyingi oyning 20-sanasigacha."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"OSAGOsiz haydash uchun jarima — 1 BHK, ogohlantirish yo'q"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Bizda «ogohlantirish yoki 0,5 BHK (206 000 so'm) jarima» deb turgan edi. MJtKning 135-1-moddasi bo'yicha jarima 1 BHK — 412 000 so'm, ogohlantirish esa nazarda tutilmagan. OSAGO va BHK sahifalarida tuzatildi."}]]}],["$","article","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Davlat bojlari: nikoh 0,2 BHK, ajralish — oraliq, onlayn ro'yxat ikki barobar arzon"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Nikohni ro'yxatdan o'tkazish boji avvalgi 1 BHK o'rniga 0,2 BHK (82 400 so'm) deb ko'rsatildi. Nikohni sud orqali bekor qilish — qat'iy 3 BHK emas, 1,5-3 BHK oralig'i, er-xotindan biri takroran nikohga kirsa 3-4 BHK. YaTTni ro'yxatdan o'tkazish yakka tartibda 1 BHK turadi, 0,5 BHK esa internet orqali topshirishdagi imtiyozli stavka; xuddi shu ikki barobar chegirma yuridik shaxsni ro'yxatdan o'tkazishda ham amal qiladi."}]]}],["$","article","3",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"JShShSga tortilmaydigan moddiy yordam BHK da emas, MIH da hisoblanadi — limit uch barobar katta"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Ish beruvchidan olingan moddiy yordam JShShSdan 4,22 BHK (1 738 640 so'm) doirasida ozod deb yozgan edik. SK 378-moddasi 1-bandi bu imtiyozni MIH da hisoblaydi: 4,22 MIH — MIH 1 271 000 so'mda 5 363 620 so'm. Limit biz ko'rsatganidan uch barobar yuqori. Hamma joyda tuzatildi. 2026-yil 1-sentabrdan imtiyoz 5 739 200 so'mgacha oshadi."}]]}],["$","article","4",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"«Uy-joy sotib olganda 500 BHK mulkiy chegirma» — bunday imtiyoz yo'q"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"JShShS va BHK sahifalarida umr davomida bir marta beriladigan 500 BHK (206 000 000 so'm) mulkiy chegirma haqida yozilgan edi. O'zbekiston Soliq kodeksida bunday norma yo'q. Haqiqiy imtiyoz — SK 378-moddasi 16-bandi: ipoteka krediti va u bo'yicha foizlarni to'lashga yo'naltirilgan daromadlar kalendar yil davomida 80 MIH (101 680 000 so'm) gacha JShShSdan ozod qilinadi."}]]}],"$L15"]}]]}]
9:["$","section","2026-08-06",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 6-avgust"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Ilovalarda: rolik ko'ring — 6 soat reklamasiz"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Android va iPhone ilovalarida reklamani olib tashlashning bepul usuli paydo bo'ldi: qisqa videorolik bannerlar va to'liq ekranli reklamani 6 soatga o'chiradi. Tugma — menyuda, «Reklamani olib tashlash» blokida. «Abadiy» bir martalik xarid ham saqlanib qoldi."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"BHK 2026-yil 1-sentabrdan 440 000 so'mgacha oshadi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Bazaviy hisoblash kattaligi 412 000 dan 440 000 so'mga oshiriladi (PF-115 Farmoni, 23.06.2026). Jarimalar, davlat bojlari, soliq chegirmalari va chegaralar BHKga bog'langan — shu jumladan QQSga o'tish chegarasi 5,28 mlrd so'm bo'ladi."}]]}],["$","article","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"JShShS: to'lov muddati qo'shildi va kim deklaratsiya topshirishi aniqlashtirildi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Avval faqat topshirish muddati — 1-aprel ko'rsatilgan edi. Deklaratsiya bo'yicha soliqni to'lash muddati qo'shildi: 1-iyundan kechiktirmay (SK 398-moddasi). Topshirish asosi ham tuzatildi: to'lov manbaida soliq ushlab qolinmagan daromadlar deklaratsiya qilinadi (393-modda)."}]]}],["$","article","3",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Pensiya va ortiqcha ish — normalar kuchga kirish sanalari aniqlashtirildi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"20+ yil stajga ega ayollarning 54 yoshda pensiyaga chiqish huquqi 2024-yil martdan amal qiladi (ZRU-922). Ortiqcha ishning yillik 120 soatlik limiti ZRU-1095 Qonuni bilan bekor qilindi (11.11.2025). Pensiya yoshlari o'zgarmadi: erkaklar 60, ayollar 55."}]]}]]}]]}]
a:["$","section","2026-07-07",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 7-iyul"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"QQSga o'tish chegarasi — 12 000 BHK (≈4,9 mlrd so'm)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"2026-yil 1-iyundan aylanma solig'idan QQS va foyda solig'iga majburiy o'tish chegarasi 1 mlrd dan 12 000 BHK = 4,944 mlrd so'mga oshirildi (UP-100 Farmoni, 26.05.2026). Chegara BHKga bog'lab indeksatsiyalanadi."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"ОСАГО — koeffitsiyentlar tuzatildi (bonus-malus)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"2026 tariflari (458-son qaror) bo'yicha ДТП soni koeffitsiyenti: avariyasiz 1,0 (chegirmasiz), keyin 1,3 / 2,0 / 3,0. 2026 tarifida mavjud bo'lmagan yosh/tajriba koeffitsiyenti olib tashlandi."}]]}],["$","article","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Bola tug'ilganda nafaqa — MROTning 70,3%"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Aniqlashtirildi: bola tug'ilganda bir martalik davlat nafaqasi («suyunchi puli») — MROTning 70,3%, 2026-yilda qariyb 893 500 so'm (110-son qaror, 04.03.2024)."}]]}]]}]]}]
b:["$","section","2026-07-06",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 6-iyul"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Suv kalkulyatori — kanalizatsiya ikki marta hisoblanishi tuzatildi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Toshkentda hisoblagich bo'yicha sovuq suv tarifi (3 808 so'm/m³) sovuq va issiq suv uchun kanalizatsiyani allaqachon o'z ichiga oladi. Kalkulyator kanalizatsiyani yana alohida (1 456 so'm/m³) qo'shib, suv hisobini oshirib yuborardi. Endi suv to'g'ri hisoblanadi: sovuq 3 808 + issiq 8 928,67 so'm/m³, takroriy hisoblashsiz."}]]}]]}]]}]
c:["$","section","2026-07-01",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 1-iyul"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Calk.UZ ilovasi App Store'da chiqdi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Calk.UZ mobil ilovasi endi iPhone va iPad uchun App Store'da mavjud: native kalkulyatorlar (ish haqi, kredit, ipoteka, bojxona, QQS va boshqalar), Markaziy bank valyuta kurslari, hisob-kitob tarixi va sevimlilar — barchasi oflayn ishlaydi. Android uchun ilova Google Play'da mavjud. Ikkala do'kon havolalari — sayt futerida."}]]}]]}]]}]
d:["$","section","2026-06-27",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 27-iyun"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Kommunal tariflar — elektr va gaz 2026-yil 1-iyundan oshdi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Kommunal kalkulyatorlar yangi tariflarga moslandi (243-son qaror): elektr energiyasi pog'onalar bo'yicha 650–2200 so'm/kVt·s, gaz 1100 so'm/m³ dan. 2025-yil tariflari yangilandi."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Jismoniy shaxslar mol-mulk solig'i — 2026 stavkalari va maydonlari"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Stavkalar indeksatsiya qilindi: 0,36% (200 m² gacha), 0,48% (200–500 m²), 0,64% (500 m² dan ortiq). Maydon oraliqlari to'g'rilandi — avval 100/200 m² eskirgan chegaralar edi."}]]}],["$","article","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Avto bojxonasi — qayta hisoblangan boj modeli"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Bojxona kalkulyatori 2026-yilgi haqiqiy sxemaga keltirildi: boj 15% (yangi) / 40% (ishlatilgan) + sm³ uchun 0,4–1,0 $, to'g'ri utilizatsiya yig'imi va ro'yxatga olish (~13 BHM). Elektromobil importiga imtiyoz 2030-yilgacha."}]]}],["$","article","3",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Soliqlar: QQS bo'sag'asi, norezident JShShS, to'lov muddatlari"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"QQS va soddalashtirilgan soliqqa ro'yxatdan o'tish bo'sag'asi — 1 mlrd so'm aylanma. Norezident JShShS — 12% (20% edi). Mol-mulk, yer va transport solig'ini jismoniy shaxslar 15 aprel va 15 oktyabrgacha to'laydi. Zararlarni o'tkazish — muddat cheklovisiz."}]]}],["$","article","4",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Mehnat va ijtimoiy: ta'til, kasallik varaqasi, aliment, pensiya"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Eng kam ta'til — 21 kalendar kun, 9 bayram kuni, ortiqcha ish soatining yillik chegarasi bekor qilindi. Kasallik varaqasi: 8 yilgacha — 60%, undan ortiq — 80%. Aliment — MROTning kamida 26,5%; 2 yoshgacha bola parvarishi nafaqasi — MROTning 60%. Eng kam pensiya — 2026-yil 1-iyuldan 983 000 so'm."}]]}],["$","article","5",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"Davlat bojlari va OSAGO"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Davlat bojlari aniqlandi: nikoh ro'yxati 0,2 BHM, MChJ — 1 BHM, sudga da'vo — da'vo qiymatining 4%. OSAGO: maksimal to'lov — 80 mln so'mgacha, polissiz haydash uchun jarima — 0,5 BHM (yoki ogohlantirish), MJtK 135-1-modda."}]]}]]}]]}]
